{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50156","headline":"读《汉书》作 · 刘知几","name":"读《汉书》作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉王有天下，欻起布衣中。\n奋飞出草泽，啸咤驭羣雄。\n淮阴既附鳯，黥彭亦攀龙，一朝逢运会，南面皆王公。\n鱼得自忘筌，鸟尽必藏弓，咄嗟罹鼎俎，赤族无遗踪。\n智裁（哉）张子房，处世独爲工；功成薄爱（受）[一]赏，（「爱」，蒋云当作「爵」。\n）高举追赤松。\n知止信无辱，身安道亦隆，悠悠[千]载後，击拚（柝）[二]仰遗风。\n（「击拚」，蒋、项皆云「拚」字不误。\n）（[一][二]并依俞说。\n刘云：「左思《咏史》，功成不受爵。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘知几","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}